OL,3,ADozens of residents to be displaced
OL,4,Aovernight as counter-terror police
OL,5,Acontinue RAF Fairford probe
OL,6,
OL,7,FGloucestershire Police say the force
OL,8,Freceived a call at about 00:45 BST on
OL,9,FSunday morning relating to "three
OL,10,Fsuspicious vehicles" travelling towards
OL,11,Fthe RAF base
OL,13,FAn image geolocated by BBC Verify
OL,14,Fappears to show the detained men close
OL,15,Fto the RAF base
OL,17,FPresident Donald Trump says the US had
OL,18,Fthe five men "under view for a long
OL,19,Ftime, and we got them"
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
