OL,3,ATwo bodies found after avalanche hits
OL,4,AHimalayan climbing group
OL,5,
OL,6,FForecasts showed there was heavy
OL,7,Fsnowfall around the 7,126m (23,380ft)
OL,8,Fpeak in recent days, which lies on
OL,9,FNepal's border with Tibet.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
